    "html": "<section id=\"cierre\" style=\"background:#FCDC8D;color:#211714;font-family:Figtree, Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n<img src=\"/pitch/barkita/ph-042.jpg\" alt=\"Perro comiendo un snack de la mano\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:820px;height:1080px;object-fit:cover\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:940px;top:300px;width:850px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:110px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-3px\">¡A rodar!</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A3F3A\">Misma marca, nuevo objetivo: que cada vídeo venda. Nos vemos en el set.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:36px;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;background:#FAF6EE;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:999px;transform:rotate(-4deg);white-space:nowrap;align-self:flex-start\">¿Esto le haría comprar?</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"/pitch/barkita/logo-h-cacao.png\" alt=\"Barkita\" style=\"position:absolute;left:940px;bottom:110px;width:260px;height:42px;object-fit:contain;object-position:left\">\n</section>"
